s, pedestals, optional grid supports and other accessories required for a complete free-access flooring system engineered to your needs. Get this useful planning guide today.</p>\n        <p class=\"mfg\">Mfg. By</p>\n        <div class=\"weber-logo\">WEBER</div>\n        <p class=\"showcase\">SHOWCASE &amp; FIXTURE CO.</p>\n        <p class=\"division\">Division of Walter Kidde &amp; Company Inc.</p>\n        <p class=\"write\">WRITE OR CALL<br>MacDONALD COMPUTER SUPPLIES<br>BOX 68-501 MIAMI 33168<br>TEL: 305/757-1091</p>\n        <p class=\"installations\">Florida &amp; Caribbean Installations<br>\n        Pratt &amp; Whitney Aircraft Company<br>\n        Boeing Aircraft Co.<br>\n        American Avionics Management Bureau<br>\n        Howard Johnson Company<br>\n        Merchants Bank-Miami<br>\n        Dade Fed. Savings &amp; Loan — Miami<br>\n        Board of Pub. Ins. — Palm Beach County<br>\n        State Fire &amp; Casualty — Miami<br>\n        Burger King Corp. — Miami<br>\n        Homestead Air Force Base<br>\n        I.B.M. Corp. Jamaica, B.W.I.<br>\n        Caroni Sugar Co. — Trinidad<br>\n        Cornell Univ. Observatory — Puerto Rico</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"middle\">\n      <h1 class=\"index-title\">ADVERTISERS’ INDEX</h1>\n      <div class=\"index\">\n        <div class=\"entry\">CLIMATE MASTER<br>PRODUCTS, INC.</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">DUNAN BRICK YARDS, INC.<br><span class=\"small\">Third Cover</span></div>\n        <div class=\"entry tight\">FLORIDA INVESTOR-OWNED<br>ELECTRIC UTILITIES<br><span class=\"number\">10 - 11</span></div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">MacDONALD COMPUTER<br>SUPPLIES CO.<br><span class=\"number\">19</span></div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">THE BEN MEADOWS CO.<br><span class=\"number\">19</span></div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">NORTHWEST ORIENT<br>AIRLINES<br><span class=\"number\">18</span></div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">OIL FUEL INSTITUTE<br>OF FLORIDA<br><span class=\"number